Dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The generator (scripts/generate_font.py) uses:

  - fontTools (MIT) — https://github.com/fonttools/fonttools
  - brotli (MIT)     — https://github.com/google/brotli
  - requests (Apache-2.0) — https://requests.readthedocs.io

The French mapping builder (scripts/build_fr_pairs.py) additionally uses,
and is the only thing that needs them, so they stay out of requirements.txt:

  - wordfreq (MIT) — https://github.com/rspeer/wordfreq
  - spaCy (MIT) + fr_core_news_md (MIT) — https://spacy.io
